- Added `mdm.android_one_time_enroll_secrets`. When enabled, the Fleet Android agent's managed configuration carries a per-device, single-use enroll secret instead of the fleet's shared enroll secret, and a shared enroll secret can no longer enroll as an existing Android host or with the ID of an Android device Fleet manages. When a shared or already used secret is refused for an Android host, Fleet sends the device a new secret.
